OL,3,GNEWSAStrictly Come Dancing star 'blown
OL,4,Aaway' by home support
OL,5,
OL,6,FA social media star who is taking part
OL,7,Fin this year's Strictly Come Dancing
OL,8,Fhas said he has been "blown away" by
OL,9,Fthe support at home.
OL,11,FJohn Nellis from County Down says he
OL,12,Fnow feels personally responsible for
OL,13,F"making or breaking" his family's
OL,14,FSaturday nights.
OL,16,FNellis made his debut on Strictly Come
OL,17,FDancing's first live show on Saturday
OL,18,F26 September with a Foxtrot routine and
OL,19,Fhas impressed the judges and audience
OL,20,Falike.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
