OL,3,GNEWSAStrictly Come Dancing star 'blown
OL,4,Aaway' by home support
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut as one of the UK's biggest sports
OL,7,Fcontent creators, who has interviewed
OL,8,Fsome of the top stars in football, he
OL,9,Fsaid he "never imagined" his career
OL,10,Fwould land him a spot on TV's top-rated
OL,11,Fentertainment show.
